{"tepid":{"id":"5a94dad7-5dd0-4ac5-9ee8-8ddbe6dad298","word":"tepid","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"lukewarm","tags":["masculine"],"word":"tépido"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"lukewarm","word":"morno"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"lukewarm","word":"tíbio"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"uninterested","word":"desinteressado"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"uninterested","word":"tíbio"}],"pos":"adj","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"I'm drinking a cup of tepid water.","bold_text_offsets":[[22,27]],"type":"example","id":"beb7019c-85df-42f6-8c47-807324350da9"}],"links":[["Lukewarm","lukewarm"],["warm","warm"],["cool","cool"]],"synonyms":[{"word":"Laodicean"},{"word":"lukewarm"},{"word":"warm","source":"Thesaurus:warm"},{"word":"tepid","source":"Thesaurus:warm"},{"word":"mild","source":"Thesaurus:warm"},{"word":"balmy","source":"Thesaurus:warm"}],"glosses":["Lukewarm; neither warm nor cool."],"categories":["English terms with usage examples"],"id":"59f24950-be44-42a4-ad8e-49123ccab9d4"},{"examples":[{"text":"He gave me a tepid response to the proposal.","bold_text_offsets":[[13,18]],"type":"example","id":"6c7b7cb4-b0ac-47d8-b436-a9795eb57436"},{"text":"The erratic behaviour of Hariri now is largely explained by the fact that his best days may be behind him, given his long absences from the country for security reasons, his declining Saudi business interests, some local challenges to his tepid leadership in recent municipal elections, and his decline in stature in the eyes of his Saudi backers.","ref":"2016 October 22, Rami G Khouri, “Lebanese oligarchy preserves its interests once again”, in Aljazeera:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[239,244]],"id":"31b42879-7cf9-4725-bb2a-3917fe02848e"}],"links":[["Uninterested","uninterested"]],"synonyms":[{"word":"uninterested"},{"word":"lukewarm"},{"word":"unconc